Scope

The MIT License above covers the code and documentation in this repository.
It does not cover:

- Member data: every file in src/content/members/. Each file holds one
  Member's personal details, submitted only to be listed in Eagle Ring. These
  files are not licensed for any other use and are not part of the Software.
  If you reuse this code for your own webring, start with an empty
  src/content/members/ folder.

- Third-party fonts in src/assets/fonts/. Bricolage Grotesque and JetBrains
  Mono are each under the SIL Open Font License; see the OFL.txt file next to
  each font.
